WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.2 · Theory of Change
Defining the problem

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Understand why the problem persists before you settle on your solution.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate symptoms and causes from your solution.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Build a problem tree with the people affected.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Mark uncertain causes as hypotheses to check.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write the problem, its scope, causes and one question to investigate.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
